  "details": "I am on a Linux (Ubuntu) PC. I can't find a way to replicate the bug, or what causes it. At seemingly completely random times, my GUI will only partly function. When I press escape, I can access the small menu, but when I click on any of the buttons, they either will not work at all, or for example, not load any of the worlds in the \"worlds\" tab. This also affects avatars, they will say \"Pending...\" over their heads until it eventually just gives up and shows an error placeholder avatar. Sometimes it will randomly resolve itself, other times it lasts for as long as I am playing. It always fixes itself on restarting the game.",
